# Frontend Application

React + TypeScript + TailwindCSS web application.

## Structure (to be created)

```
frontend/
├── src/
│   ├── components/
│   ├── features/
│   ├── hooks/
│   ├── pages/
│   ├── services/
│   ├── store/
│   └── utils/
├── public/
├── package.json
└── tsconfig.json
```

## Tech Stack

- React 18
- TypeScript 5
- TailwindCSS 3
- React Query
- Zustand
- React Router 6
- Axios
